  "body": "[createPattern](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#dom-context-2d-createpattern) does not define how to resolve images without defined natural dimensions (e.g. some SVG images).\r\n\r\nThe user visible symptom here is that creating a pattern with an SVG image with no defined width/height is undefined.\r\n\r\nMy proposal would be to factor out the logic in [drawImage](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#dom-context-2d-drawimage) used when no source size is provided, which essentially boils down to running the [default sizing algorithm](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-images/#default-sizing) with a default object size set to the canvas' output bitmap. ",
